                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "BladeShield, a Lighsaber-swinger and robot-trasher in VR! Well, not bad at all actually! \nHere is a MIXED REALITY gameplay of Bladeshield, first 15 minutes:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bibGGptalI4\n\nWell, yeah its quite a simple game, but I´m actually surprised how good it looks and feels in VR, with all the flying robots, drones and all the explosions around you. \n\nBut still, the best part of BladeShield in VR is actually those two LIGHSABERS you use as weapons - it gives you that special Star Wars-feeling I´ve been missing in Virtual Reality so far. Or why not use a Lightsaber in each hand - with different lightning colors as well. In Virtual Reality, even the most simple things gives you kind of a \"new\" experience :)\n\nGraphics are detailed and sharp, sound effects are good and the action keeps you in focus all the time - this is pure VR arcade and its not bad at all! Why not grab a copy and try it out - its a fairly simple but entertaining arcade game you can enjoy from time to time - or why not use it as a show-off for your friends while they discover VR for the first time :) I´m sure you will enjoy it!\n\nFor the price - I recommend it!",
